This repository builds on the following projects. Their files are not copied
here: the web interface reads them from their own repositories. What is
derived from them is described next to each.

Code databases, read to build fingerprints.json (which records each remote's
path, name, protocol, address, commands and frame bits):

- Flipper-IRDB, https://github.com/logickworkshop/Flipper-IRDB
  CC0-1.0

- Flipper IRDB, https://github.com/flipperdevices/IRDB
  MIT License, Copyright (c) Flipper Zero

- SmartIR, https://github.com/smartHomeHub/SmartIR
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2019 Vassilis Panos

- WigShop, https://github.com/DAB-LABS/WigShop
  CC0-1.0

- LIRC remotes, https://github.com/probonopd/lirc-remotes
  (mirror of https://sourceforge.net/p/lirc-remotes)
  No license is stated by the project or its mirror. Linux distributions
  package these files as GPL-2.0-or-later. fingerprints.json keeps only
  protocol, address and command numbers and frame bits from them.

Code generator:

- IRremoteESP8266, https://github.com/crankyoldgit/IRremoteESP8266
  LGPL-2.1
  The codes under codes/ACs were generated by encoding air conditioner states
  with this library. Only the generated codes are in this repository; the
  library is not distributed here.

Protocol references (timing constants, bit layouts, cross-checks; no code
copied):

- Flipper Zero firmware, https://github.com/flipperdevices/flipperzero-firmware
  GPL-3.0
- infrared-protocols, https://github.com/home-assistant-libs/infrared-protocols
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Home Assistant Team
